		(property "Design Notes" "Bias-T choke L1 of Integration manual Figure 33 / Table 26, isolating RF from the DC path. 47 nH reaches ~570 Ohm at 1575 MHz, clearing Table 26's >= 500 Ohm requirement that the previous 27 nH part missed (~330 Ohm). Verify at order: current rating >= 300 mA (Table 26 minimum) and DCR ~0.3 Ohm, which the R50 short-circuit calculation assumes. Active-antenna option only: fit with C52 and R50, do not fit for a passive antenna."
			(at 212.09 76.2 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
