		(property "Design Notes" "GNSS antenna feed. SMA jack (female), 50 Ohm, through-hole right-angle, brass. The footprint SMA_Amphenol_901-143_Horizontal is drawn for Amphenol 901-143; order brass 132136 (DigiKey ACX1232-ND), same 5-hole pattern as 901-143-6RFX. RF_IN must arrive here as a via-shielded grounded co-planar 50 Ohm waveguide with no stubs (IM 4.8.4.1). Site the antenna as far from the BG95 antenna as the install allows."
